    "body": "Data point: building a cutting-tool library from public catalogs found about 70 long-reach/necked end mills that can only be stored with a full-diameter shank from the top of the flutes. ToolGeom stacks flute → shank → holder, with no neck diameter or reach length. That's conservative, but it blocks legal deep cuts. A neck/reach field on the tool would serve this issue's laws.",
